{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他明知道回去未必能找回过去的亲近，却还是舍不得，忍不住盼着还有可能，同时开始尝试把重心放回眼下。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、盼望、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"他仍怕以后独自承担事情，也没有底气，但不愿因此撤回已经作出的打算；底部从试探到向前的变化需要读说明文字才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还想着回去找回那份亲近，但不打算只靠这点希望决定自己的生活，而是想先把眼下过稳。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、期待、犹豫、害怕\",\n      \"missed\": \"第二段后半部分关于独自扛事的担忧和不愿撤回打算的矛盾不容易一眼抓到；底部线点逐渐聚拢，但不直接等于人物在向前走。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他虽然还舍不得过去，也仍然害怕未来，但正在尝试不再执着于回头，先继续往前走。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、害怕、没底、克制、向前\",\n      \"missed\": \"他具体为什么害怕、以后可能要独自承担什么，以及为什么不愿收回刚才的打算，都藏在第二段长句里；底部排列得更整齐，但仍然是抽象的音乐线点，人物行动的含义不够直接。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段同样醒目的大字并列，尤其第二段一口气塞入了回不回去、先稳定生活、害怕独自承担、不愿撤回打算等多层意思。一眼能抓到他舍不得过去、还抱着希望，也能从绿色提示看到先过好眼下，但最重要的心理转折和害怕与前进并存的状态，需要继续读长句才能完整串起来。底部抽象音符动画有动态变化，却不能独立呈现人物处境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b3bcc707-21ef-4ef8-ac4f-e7009ab78ebf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001557992808Z", "elapsed_seconds": 125.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:18:03.124111+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df4678d7fcdda74a087203a43b23e70b613f8c0f8606ee6407fa4a7f297be3df", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001557992808Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4307c1938aa85c24d0f7fb37320e6f5858c97d3539b9a9e94ffc52fc9ea3cadf"}}}
